---
/**
 * @category Pricing
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Pricing
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 xl:grid-cols-4 xl:gap-8'>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between md:gap-10 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:justify-start xl:gap-6'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Ceník</h2>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 md:max-w-sm'>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Každá nabídka obsahuje celý editor a export běžných souborů Astro.</p>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm leading-normal text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Ceny v korunách za měsíc. Zrušit můžete kdykoli.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 md:grid-rows-[repeat(9,auto)] md:gap-x-4 md:gap-y-0 xl:col-span-3'>
      <div class='flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:row-span-9 md:grid md:grid-rows-subgrid md:px-5 md:ring-0 xl:px-6 dark:ring-stone-700'>
        <div class='flex min-h-8 items-center gap-3 pb-5'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Snídaně</h3>
        </div>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>$</span><span class='text-7xl font-light tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>0</span>&nbsp;měsíčně</p>
        <p class='m-0 pb-6 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Na kávu a koláč, nebo ať si to nejdřív zkusíte.</p>
        <a href='#' class='mb-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Začněte zdarma</a>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>1 prodejna</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Subdoména pekárny</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>přehled nákupů za 7 dní</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Pro jednoho</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Pomoc u pultu</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(28_25_23/0.06),0_16px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_25_23/0.18)] ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:row-span-9 md:grid md:grid-rows-subgrid md:px-5 xl:px-6 dark:bg-stone-800 dark:ring-stone-700'>
        <div class='flex min-h-8 flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-5'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Dort</h3>
          <span class='rounded-full bg-sky-100 px-3 py-1 font-sans text-sm font-medium leading-none text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-950 dark:text-sky-200'>Nejoblíbenější</span>
        </div>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>$</span><span class='text-7xl font-light tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>12</span>&nbsp;měsíčně</p>
        <p class='m-0 pb-6 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Na dort k oslavě, nebo koláče do kanceláře.</p>
        <a href='#' class='mb-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-yellow-400 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-yellow-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-yellow-400'>Začít s Profi</a>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Neomezeně webů</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Rozvoz po městě</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>přehled nákupů za 90 dní</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Pro jednoho</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Napište nám e-mail</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:row-span-9 md:grid md:grid-rows-subgrid md:px-5 md:ring-0 xl:px-6 dark:ring-stone-700'>
        <div class='flex min-h-8 items-center gap-3 pb-5'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Tým</h3>
        </div>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>$</span><span class='text-7xl font-light tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>39</span>&nbsp;měsíčně</p>
        <p class='m-0 pb-6 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Pro partu, která si sedne k jednomu stolu.</p>
        <a href='#' class='mb-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Začít s týmem</a>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Neomezeně webů</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Rozvoz po městě</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Celá historie objednávek</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Až 10 lidí</p>
        <p class='m-0 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50'>Přednostní výdej</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
